<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Tiananmen Square Massacre — Timeline (April–June 1989)</title>
<style>
  :root {
