        <div class="event">
            <span class="date">April 15, 1989</span>
            <p>The death of former Communist Party General Secretary <strong>Hu Yaobang</strong>, a reformist leader, sparks student gatherings in Tiananmen Square to mourn and call for political reforms.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="event">
            <span class="date">April 17–22, 1989</span>
            <p>Thousands of students from Beijing universities march to Tiananmen Square, demanding greater freedom of speech, a free press, and democratic reforms. The movement spreads to other cities.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="event">
            <span class="date">April 26, 1989</span>
